This repository builds and packages Cerebro for Docker.

Cerebro application code is based on Leonardo Menezes' cerebro 0.9.4
and is licensed under the MIT License.
Upstream: https://github.com/lmenezes/cerebro
Release: https://github.com/lmenezes/cerebro/releases/tag/v0.9.4

This fork rebuilds that application against Play Framework 3.0 / Pekko
on Java 21 and ships it as version 0.10.0.
